From 1105db7d5772ecef133f3338da416328ff73c2e8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sneezeparty <38020091+sneezeparty@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 06:13:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] Show each virtual desktop's own wallpaper in the overview

DesktopBackground reports the image of a desktop whose wallpaper differs from what the single desktop window shows, read from Plasma's containment configuration, and the overview's grid and desktop bar draw it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
